  "details": "I've always invisioned VRChat having a tools section, partly for accessibility to assist users with tools such as:\n- camera (would be moved to this)\n- marker (Either local or global)\n- magnify glass\n- watch\n- Flash Light\n- sound isolator (Point at user to list specifically too)\n- fan (to block or limit portion of view in certain 'flashy' worlds where limiting vision would prevent eyestrain)\n- Text to speech keyboard (Consider)\n- Speech to Text for hearing impaired (Consider)\nAnd of course some of these tools, to avoid 'cheating' in some worlds, or even spying, should have a limited range.",
